.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-06T18:41:00-07:00","id":1204061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lion Hamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1203337-disconnect-between-sorcery-in-lore-and-the-encouraged-use-in-game?p=1204058#post1204058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The difference being SP charms aren't their entire skill set, they'll usually end up picking up another martial art and even if they don't they still have the entire melee charm tree which also applies to their martial arts</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> ...no it doesn't. I'm mostly tapped out here, but...like...no. Melee charms don't apply to Martial Arts attacks. Athletics charms, ironically, do. And if you want <i>uber death kill</i> atheletics is mandatory for those sweet sweet damage multipliers. Shining Point is doubly screwed because as far as I'm aware, it only combos with 1other martial arts at the moment (steel devil).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co