e-encouraged-use-in-game?p=1210228#post1210228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which are not required for solars.</div> </div> </div> </div>Required for solars, seriously?<br /> If you only got what is &quot;necessary&quot; exalted would be a very different game","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23635-lion-hamster","name":"Lion Hamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T20:26:21-07:00","id":1210256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you only got what is &quot;necessary&quot; exalted would be a very different game </div> </div> </div>Mmmnope, you can play as mortals and you're still playing Exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T20:38:55-07:00","id":1210259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lion Hamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1203337-disconnect-between-sorcery-in-lore-and-the-encouraged-use-in-game?p=1210254#post1210254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Required for solars, seriously?<br /> If you only got what is &quot;necessary&quot; exalted would be a very different game</div> </div> </div> </div>What is necessary for a solar to perform sorcery?<br /> <br /> Here is an easy peasy list:<br /> The Charms for each sorcerous circle: Check<br /> Sorcerous Initiations in a wide variety, showing multiple designs, and examples of how to build additional thematic initiations: Check<br /> Examples of multiple types of spells of each circle, their controls, and how the levels of power work: Check<br /> Examples of every tier of sorcerous workings, granular detail of how they are performed, and mechanics for even failure: check<br /> Additional charms inside of Occult which have the added benefit of boosting Sorcery in addition to other Occult Rolls: Check<br /> <br /> As Alucard said, you are essentially getting a bucket of legos and asking why you did not have anything to play with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11967-saipjas","user":"Saipjas","date":". 04-23-2018, 12:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11967-saipjas","name":"Saipjas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T22:21:51-07:00","id":1210289,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote